home years earlier, Kurona, Nashiro, and Suzuya are reunited in combat at Cochlea. Ayato faces an uphill battle against Shinohara, who is equipped with armor created from the remnants of his own father, Arata.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281249/5107721.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"裂目\"},{\"title\":\"Thousand Paths\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Suzuya's hellish boyhood is revisited, and it is revealed how he came to work for CCG. As Touka studies for her entrance exams, Roma, a new waitress, fills in for her at Anteiku. Tempers erupt when Akira joins Amon and Seido for supper.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281249/5107722.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"千路\"},{\"title\":\"Permeation\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tsukiyama shows up at Anteiku with news for Yoshimura about Kaneki's attempt to become a kakuja via serial ghoul cannibalism. Concerned over her \\\"Big Brother,\\\" Hinami accompanies Tsukiyama to a coffee shop, where she again runs into Takatsuki.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281249/5111740.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"透過\"},{\"title\":\"Old Nines\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"During Kaneki's visit with Yoshimura, he asks for information about the Owl, and is told the tragic tale of a young ghoul named Kuzen. Touka makes plans to move out of Anteiku. A snowy day brings with it brisk business at the coffee shop.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281249/5111741.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"旧九\"},{\"title\":\"City in Waiting\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yoshitoki is granted permission to execute the operation to eradicate the Owl. The many CCG officers involved in the mission take time beforehand to write any last words they might have, as the 20th Ward is cordoned off and its civilians evacuated.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281249/5111742.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"街望\"},{\"title\":\"Last Rain\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle between CCG and Anteiku continues, and Koma, Irimi, and Yoshimura each engage the special investigators. When a civilian gets caught in the middle, Hachikawa continues to press his attack unabated. Shinohara receives some unexpected advice.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281249/5111743.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"終雨\"},{\"title\":\"Deluge of Flowers\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Suzuya is left to face the newly-arrived one-eyed Owl on his own. Aogiri Tree joins the battle against CCG, who find themselves overwhelmed by the sheer number of opponents. Meanwhile, Kaneki confronts Amon, who stands in his way to Anteiku.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281249/5150515.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"溢花\"},{\"title\":\"Ken\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kaneki and Hide are reunited, and the two of them revisit the times they spent together. Kaneki and Touka separately remember the other members of Anteiku, as both they and CCG cope with their losses.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281249/5150516.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"研\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":[]}